            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Agent workspaces

- The worktree picker shows each agent’s provider and CLI name, so agents with the same display name are easier to tell apart.
- Create a local agent or sync Grok Bot agents directly from the picker.
- Resume a linked Claude Code or Cursor Agent conversation from the worktree’s Overview. Weft opens the saved conversation in its assigned checkout.
]]></description>
